menu "Smart Safety Band configuration"

    config SAFETY_BAND_SOS_GPIO
        int "SOS push-button GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 4
        help
            GPIO wired to the emergency push button. GPIO41 is reserved for the
            SIM868 power-key line; the reference design uses
            an active-low button with the internal pull-up enabled.

    config SAFETY_BAND_MOTION_INT_GPIO
        int "Motion interrupt GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 2
        help
            Reserved for the accelerometer interrupt on the GL868 reference
            board. The current motion task polls at 20 ms.

    config SAFETY_BAND_SIMULATION
        bool "Simulate missing health and environment sensors"
        default n
        help
            Allows real-time firmware development before optional modules are
            available. The real accelerometer is always preferred; only absent
            health/environment modules produce clearly labelled simulated data.

    config SAFETY_BAND_EMERGENCY_NUMBER
        string "Emergency contact number"
        default "+916309538622"
        help
            Phone number for SMS alerts and emergency call routing through the
            GL868 modem. Update this to your whitelist recipient before flashing.

endmenu
